3. BUILD AND CHECK TOOLING (not distributed in compiled form)
==============================================================

The check crates (kernels/*/check, kernels/moxzi-rsa/check/fuel-probe) and the build-time
dependencies of the kernel crates (build scripts, procedural macros) use further crates from
crates.io, all under permissive licenses: MIT OR Apache-2.0 for most; Apache-2.0 WITH
LLVM-exception (wasmtime, cranelift, regalloc2 and related Bytecode Alliance crates, used
by fuel-probe); Apache-2.0 (the libcrux crates and libcrux-macros); MIT; BSD-2-Clause and
BSD-3-Clause (the crates of section 2); Zlib (foldhash); Unlicense OR MIT (memchr,
termcolor); and (MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND Unicode-3.0 (unicode-ident). They are fetched by
cargo and not included here.
